Alonecraft Talent Calculator
============================

Talent point rules (tier gating, prerequisite satisfaction, add/remove
validation) and the prerequisite-arrow geometry in js/talents.js and
js/tree.js are adapted from wowsims/wotlk, reimplemented in plain JavaScript
and decoupled from that project's Player/protobuf types.

