The wowsims project asks that anyone using its work provide a user-visible
link back to the original project; that link is in the page footer.

Note on scope: wowsims' talent picker sources every talent name, description
and icon from Wowhead at runtime.  That cannot work for a server with custom
talents, so the tooltip layer here is original work, generated by
tools/export_talents.py from this server's own DBC files.

Icon artwork under assets/icons/ is extracted from the World of Warcraft
client and remains the property of Blizzard Entertainment.
